---
const CRICKET_MANAGER_WIDGET = 'https://store.steampowered.com/widget/5072330/';
const PLATATTACK_WIDGET = 'https://store.steampowered.com/widget/5103330/';
---

<section class="hobbies wrap" id="hobbies">
  <h2>Hobbies</h2>
  <p class="hobbies-lead">
    Game development is what I do for myself on the side under Shushi Studios. Building and shipping independent games:
    Cricket Manager 27 (Steam, 29 Oct 2026) and PlatAttack (Steam, Q4 2026).
  </p>
  <div class="steam-widgets">
    <div class="steam-widget">
      <iframe
        src={CRICKET_MANAGER_WIDGET}
        title="Cricket Manager 27 on Steam"
        width="646"
        height="190"
        loading="lazy"
      ></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="steam-widget">
      <iframe
        src={PLATATTACK_WIDGET}
        title="PlatAttack on Steam"
        width="646"
        height="190"
        loading="lazy"
      ></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
